Stream batch Parakeet TDT models through the sliding-window transcriber.

Multilingual Parakeet TDT v3 models lack a cache-aware streaming graph.
When parakeet.streaming is enabled for a known non-streaming Parakeet
model, wrap the batch transcriber in SlidingWindowStreamingTranscriber.

